            <ArticleTitle>[Method of determining the area of nonperfused myocardium during coronary-occlusion ischemia using trypan blue-stained microspheres].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>94-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors developed a method for measurement of the area of the non-perfused myocardium with the aid of stained latex microspheres in rats with coronaro-occlusion ischemia followed and not followed by reperfusion. The method can be used for studying the therapeutic effect of the drugs in rats with coronaro-occlusion myocardial ischemia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
